    "Text color": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框保留 macOS 的标准编辑按键。对话框共用上面设置的「应用/取消」。数字输入框用上下方向键调整，按住 Shift 步长更大。macOS 标准命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器本身在非录制状态下始终用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击可编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑类快捷键需要搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，以免影响正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
